# Pairs with BulkHintBound. Issue #5752: a resumed narrow of a leaf an earlier attempt
# already narrowed must report no frontier, since its replay may have passed a record
# of the range since without holding it. Reporting its current read position as the
# frontier lets the capped hint pass that record.
MODULE: BulkHintBoundResumedNarrowReportsFrontier
TARGET: BulkHintBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a resumed narrow of an already-narrowed leaf reports its read position as the frontier
PERTURBS: Narrow

--- FIND
    /\ relocOk' = ~narrowed
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the resumed narrow reports a frontier.
    /\ relocOk' = TRUE
--- END